WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
PCV valve
What it does: Meters crankcase vapours into the intake so they can be burned again.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
PCV valve
How it works: The PCV meters their exit towards the intake.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
PCV valve
How it moves: The body remains fixed; the internal element responds to pressure differences.
